# ── Domain canonicalisation ──────────────────────────────────────────────────
# unifiedwireandcable.com is the legacy domain (email signatures, print, the
# Google listing). It must keep resolving forever, but it should NOT serve a
# second copy of the site — that splits SEO between two identical domains.
# Send every request to unifiedwire.com, preserving the path.
# Forced (!) because real files exist at these paths and would otherwise win.
# The www rules stay inert until the www CNAME exists in DNS; harmless till then.
https://unifiedwireandcable.com/*       https://unifiedwire.com/:splat      301!
https://www.unifiedwireandcable.com/*   https://unifiedwire.com/:splat      301!
http://unifiedwireandcable.com/*        https://unifiedwire.com/:splat      301!
http://www.unifiedwireandcable.com/*    https://unifiedwire.com/:splat      301!

# Serve home.html at domain root
/                               /home.html                          200

# Spec Navigator — the old encrypted-snapshot page (spec-navigator.html) is a
# stale build: it still carries NM-B/Romex and local image paths that 404.
# The live engine is products.html. Force these to it so no shared link lands
# on the broken snapshot. Forced (!) because the old file still exists on disk.
/spec-navigator                 /products                           301!
/spec-navigator.html            /products                           301!

